WEBVTT

00:00:04.611 --> 00:00:06.439
You're staying here!
你留在这里！

00:00:06.613 --> 00:00:09.094
I'm going.
And you can't stop me.
我要走了，你无法阻止我

00:00:09.964 --> 00:00:11.270
Whoa!

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.708
OK. I wasn't ready that time.
好，我那次防备不足

00:00:14.882 --> 00:00:16.580
Guys? Don't.
各位，别这样

00:00:16.754 --> 00:00:17.798
Ready.
预备

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.496
Look!
看！

00:00:20.801 --> 00:00:22.499
[screams]

00:00:26.111 --> 00:00:28.070
- Aaaah!
- [thudding]

00:00:32.074 --> 00:00:33.423
Stay down.
退下

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.601
- I have to get to him.
- Then tell me why!
告诉我为什么！

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.910
He was there! OK?
我见到我爹娘时孔雀也在场

00:00:43.085 --> 00:00:46.262
The peacock was there
the last time
I saw my parents.
我见到我爹娘时孔雀也在场

00:00:46.436 --> 00:00:50.048
He knows what happened.
Where I came from.
他知道事情的全过程，
我从哪里来，我是谁

00:00:50.222 --> 00:00:52.616
Who I am.
他知道事情的全过程，
我从哪里来，我是谁

00:00:56.315 --> 00:00:58.274
Look, I'm going.
我走了

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:01.451
I have to know.
我要知道

00:01:01.625 --> 00:01:04.454
- The hardcore
can't understand.
- Tigress, no!
会硬功的不会明白

00:01:09.676 --> 00:01:11.635
The hardcore do understand.
会硬功的能明白

00:01:13.376 --> 00:01:17.249
But I can't watch
my friend be killed.
但我不能看着朋友送命

00:01:17.423 --> 00:01:21.514
- We're going.
- Maybe you can't
watch me be killed?
也许你不愿意看着我送命？

00:01:21.688 --> 00:01:24.561
- Stop being a wimp.
- And she's back.
她归位了

00:01:26.258 --> 00:01:28.391
- No.
- Don't worry, kid.
别怕，孩子，你待在这里最好

00:01:28.565 --> 00:01:30.306
You're better off here.
别怕，孩子，你待在这里最好

00:01:39.967 --> 00:01:42.056
[Shen] You were wrong,
Soothsayer.
你错了，算卦大师，我们等着今晚的胜利

00:01:42.231 --> 00:01:45.147
We sail to victory tonight.
你错了，算卦大师，我们等着今晚的胜利

00:01:45.321 --> 00:01:47.627
Your magic panda
is clearly a fool.
你的魔术熊猫显然是个傻子

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:50.717
Are you certain
it is the panda who is a fool?
你肯定傻的是熊猫？

00:01:50.891 --> 00:01:53.329
You just destroyed
your ancestral home, Shen.
你毁了祖宗留下的家业

00:01:53.503 --> 00:01:58.812
A trivial sacrifice
when all of China
is my reward.
等到中国全归我就是对我的奖赏

00:01:58.986 --> 00:02:01.380
Then will you finally
be satisfied?
你到最后会满足吗？

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:03.643
Will the subjugation
of the whole world
征服全世界能让你开心吗？

00:02:03.817 --> 00:02:05.776
finally make you
feel better?
征服全世界能让你开心吗？

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:07.560
Mmm, it's a start.
这仅仅是开始

00:02:07.734 --> 00:02:10.302
I might also convert
the basement into a dungeon.
我说不定会把地下室改建成地牢

00:02:13.262 --> 00:02:16.003
The cup you choose to fill
has no bottom.
你是个无底洞

00:02:16.178 --> 00:02:19.093
It is time to stop
this madness.
别继续疯狂了

00:02:20.225 --> 00:02:22.096
Why on earth
would I do that?
为什么？

00:02:22.271 --> 00:02:25.143
So your parents
can rest in peace.
好让你爹娘在九泉之下安心

00:02:25.317 --> 00:02:28.190
My parents hated me.
我爹娘最恨的就是我

00:02:29.495 --> 00:02:31.062
Do you understand?
你懂吗？

00:02:32.542 --> 00:02:34.718
They wronged me.
他们错怪了我

00:02:34.892 --> 00:02:37.895
And... I will make it right.
我要纠正他们

00:02:38.069 --> 00:02:39.331
They loved you.
他们爱你

00:02:39.505 --> 00:02:41.028
They loved you so much
他们太爱你了，所以送走你让他们送了命

00:02:41.203 --> 00:02:44.206
that having to send you
away killed them.
他们太爱你了，所以送走你让他们送了命

00:02:46.904 --> 00:02:49.341
The dead exist in the past...
亡故的属于过去

00:02:50.386 --> 00:02:52.649
...and I must tend
to the future.
我只顾将来

00:02:57.523 --> 00:03:01.571
Set the Soothsayer free.
She's no use to me.
放了算卦大师，她对我已没用了

00:03:01.745 --> 00:03:03.312
Goodbye, Shen.
再见，阿沈，希望你得到幸福

00:03:03.486 --> 00:03:05.357
I wish you happiness.
再见，阿沈，希望你得到幸福

00:03:05.531 --> 00:03:08.230
Happiness must be taken...
幸福必定属于我

00:03:09.883 --> 00:03:12.190
...and I will take mine.
我绝不会放过

00:03:25.943 --> 00:03:26.987
Huh?

00:03:33.777 --> 00:03:35.257
[Wolf Soldier] Hurry it up!
动作快点！

00:03:37.998 --> 00:03:39.913
If all of those weapons
leave the building,
这些武器一旦离开这里，全中国就会毁灭

00:03:40.087 --> 00:03:41.524
China will fall.
这些武器一旦离开这里，全中国就会毁灭

00:03:41.698 --> 00:03:44.004
- We bring down the building!
- Hey, guys.
我们毁了这座楼！

00:03:44.178 --> 00:03:45.571
How about this?
各位，这样如何？

00:03:47.007 --> 00:03:49.053
Oh! This will work!
肯定管用！ 好，我们走

00:03:49.227 --> 00:03:52.012
- All right, let's go.
- I can't feel my face.
肯定管用！ 好，我们走

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:57.801
[gasps]

00:03:59.498 --> 00:04:00.586
Aargh!

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.284
[groaning]

00:04:07.724 --> 00:04:09.987
[mumbling] Did you hear him
call it Year of the Peacock?
听到他说现在是孔雀元年么？

00:04:10.161 --> 00:04:11.815
- [scoffs]
- Hey.
嗨

00:04:11.989 --> 00:04:13.033
Hey.
嗨

00:04:13.207 --> 00:04:14.600
OK. Keep it cool.
Keep it cool.
一定要镇定

00:04:14.774 --> 00:04:17.168
[Guard] You!
Where are you going?
你！上哪儿去？

00:04:19.301 --> 00:04:20.737
On your feet!
站住！少跟我傻笑

00:04:20.911 --> 00:04:22.739
And wipe those stupid grins
off your faces.
站住！少跟我傻笑

00:04:31.225 --> 00:04:33.576
[wolf howling]

00:04:36.187 --> 00:04:37.362
[Shen] Move, you dogs!
快走，你们这帮狗！快点！赶快装炮！

00:04:37.536 --> 00:04:39.930
Faster, faster.
Load them all.
快走，你们这帮狗！快点！赶快装炮！

00:04:48.895 --> 00:04:50.070
[Shen laughs]

00:04:50.244 --> 00:04:52.290
Greetings, panda.
你好，熊猫

00:04:52.986 --> 00:04:54.205
[gasps]

00:04:55.902 --> 00:04:57.382
Tell me what happened
that night.
告诉我那晚发生的事

00:04:57.556 --> 00:04:58.905
What night?
哪一晚？

00:04:59.079 --> 00:05:02.082
- That night.
- Ah, that night.
啊，那天晚上

00:05:02.256 --> 00:05:05.172
Yes. We're talking
about the same night, right?
对！

00:05:05.347 --> 00:05:07.610
Yes, I was there.
对，我在场，我看着…

00:05:07.784 --> 00:05:09.916
Yes. I watched
as your parents abandoned you.
你爹娘抛弃了你，真惨!

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:11.657
It's a terrible thing.
你爹娘抛弃了你，真惨!

00:05:11.831 --> 00:05:13.877
I believe it went
something like this.
我相信事情的经过是这样的

00:05:15.052 --> 00:05:16.053
Waah!

00:05:17.663 --> 00:05:20.013
Aaaah!

00:05:23.452 --> 00:05:24.670
[grunts]

00:05:24.844 --> 00:05:26.368
Here's your New Year's gift.
这是给你们的新年礼物!

00:05:26.542 --> 00:05:28.587
Hope you like it
'cause you can't return it.
希望你喜欢，因为你没法退货！

00:05:28.761 --> 00:05:30.328
- [chuckles]
- [Po] Aargh!
希望你喜欢，因为你没法退货！

00:05:30.502 --> 00:05:32.852
Po? What's he doing here?
阿宝？他在这里做什么？

00:05:33.853 --> 00:05:35.028
Return it! Return it!
退货！退货！

00:05:40.164 --> 00:05:41.731
Yah! Hah!

00:05:43.602 --> 00:05:45.387
[shrieks]

00:05:47.171 --> 00:05:49.652
[chuckling] Are you willing
to die to find the truth?
你愿意为了真理牺牲吗？

00:05:49.826 --> 00:05:51.218
You bet I am.
当然愿意！尽管我并不喜欢

00:05:51.393 --> 00:05:53.351
Although I'd prefer not to.
当然愿意！尽管我并不喜欢

00:05:53.525 --> 00:05:54.700
Yow!
当然愿意！尽管我并不喜欢

00:05:57.007 --> 00:05:58.791
Waargh!

00:05:59.575 --> 00:06:00.663
[grunts]

00:06:03.622 --> 00:06:04.928
[groans]

00:06:09.759 --> 00:06:11.282
[grunting]

00:06:16.156 --> 00:06:17.593
[Mantis] We got them. Go!
我们能打赢他们，走！

00:06:17.767 --> 00:06:18.724
Wah!
我们能打赢他们，走！

00:06:19.421 --> 00:06:20.639
Yah!

00:06:20.813 --> 00:06:21.988
- [roars]
- [snarls]

00:06:22.641 --> 00:06:23.990
[Tigress grunts]

00:06:25.514 --> 00:06:26.950
Whoa! Oh!

00:06:32.085 --> 00:06:35.654
[screaming]

00:06:39.702 --> 00:06:41.094
[Po] You looking for me?
你找我？

00:06:46.535 --> 00:06:47.971
Um...

00:06:48.145 --> 00:06:49.625
I said that too soon,
didn't I?
我话说太快了，对吧?

00:06:49.799 --> 00:06:52.236
Kee-ya! Ahhh!
我话说太快了，对吧?

00:06:58.329 --> 00:06:59.330
Po!
阿宝！

00:07:04.291 --> 00:07:05.815
Po, get away from him.
阿宝！别跟他太近！

00:07:05.989 --> 00:07:07.904
I'll get up.
Here we go.
我会跟上…看招

00:07:10.733 --> 00:07:11.821
No more running, Shen.
姓沈的，别跑了 看来也是

00:07:11.995 --> 00:07:13.387
So it seems.
姓沈的，别跑了 看来也是

00:07:13.562 --> 00:07:15.564
Now... answers.
乖乖回答问题

00:07:15.738 --> 00:07:17.435
Oh, you want to know so badly.
你这么急于了解真相

00:07:17.609 --> 00:07:18.915
[breathing heavily]
你这么急于了解真相

00:07:19.089 --> 00:07:22.353
You think knowing
will heal you, huh?
你以为知道真相就能治愈你的创伤？

00:07:22.527 --> 00:07:26.618
Fill some crater
in your soul?
满足情感的痛苦

00:07:26.792 --> 00:07:28.881
Well, here's your answer.
这就是你的答案

00:07:29.055 --> 00:07:32.058
Your parents
didn't love you.
你爹妈不爱你

00:07:33.146 --> 00:07:35.061
But here,
来…

00:07:35.235 --> 00:07:37.760
let me heal you!
让我来治愈你！

00:07:37.934 --> 00:07:38.891
[gasps]

00:07:42.068 --> 00:07:43.026
[metallic snarl]

00:07:43.635 --> 00:07:45.245
- Ah!
- No!
不好！

00:07:52.078 --> 00:07:53.036
Oh!

00:07:59.608 --> 00:08:02.175
[thunderclap]

